{"ticker":"AAPL","updated":"2026-11-20T22:33:37Z","profile":{"longName":"Apple Inc.","shortName":"Apple Inc.","sector":"Technology","industry":"Consumer Electronics","country":"United States","website":"https://www.apple.com","fullTimeEmployees":167000,"marketCap":4978144444416,"trailingPE":38.146996,"forwardPE":32.400333,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":10.396389,"pegRatio":2.85,"targetMeanPrice":345.6313,"targetHighPrice":425.0,"targetLowPrice":250.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":39,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.117,"earningsGrowth":0.141,"grossMargins":0.48786,"operatingMargins":0.33009997,"profitMargins":0.27604,"totalRevenue":478833999872,"beta":1.089,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":360.83,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":243.42,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.31},"summary":"Apple Inc. designs, manufactures, and markets smartphones, personal computers, tablets, wearables, and accessories. The company offers iPhone, a line of smartphones; Mac, a line of personal computers; iPad, a line of multi-purpose tablets; and wearables, home, and accessories, including Apple Watch, AirPods, Beats products, Apple Vision Pro, Apple TV 4K, HomePod, and Apple HomeView, as well as Apple branded and third-party accessories. It also provides advertising services comprising third-party licensing arrangements and own advertising platforms; AppleCare and cloud services; and payment services, including Apple Card and Apple Pay. In addition, the company operates App Store that allow customers to discover and download applications and digital content, such as books, music, video, games, and podcasts. Further, it provides digital content through subscription-based services, including Apple Arcade, a game service; Apple Fitness+, a personalized fitness service; Apple Music, which offers users a curated listening experience; Apple News+, a news and magazine service; and Apple TV, which offers original content and live sports. The company sells its products and resells third-party products through its retail and online stores, and direct sales force; its services through its various service platforms; and third-party cellular network carriers and other resellers. It serves con","summary_zh":"蘋果設計、製造和銷售智慧型手機、個人電腦、平板電腦、穿戴式裝置和配件。该公司提供 iPhone 等一系列智能手机； Mac，一系列个人电脑； iPad，一系列多功能平板电脑；可穿戴设备、家居和配件，包括 Apple Watch、AirPods、Beats 产品、Apple Vision Pro、Apple TV 4K、HomePod 和 Apple HomeView，以及 Apple 品牌和第三方配件。它还提供广告服务，包括第三方许可安排和自有广告平台； AppleCare 和云服务；以及支付服务，包括 Apple Card 和 Apple Pay。此外，该公司还运营 App Store，允许客户发现和下载应用程序和数字内容，例如书籍、音乐、视频、游戏和播客。此外，它还通过基于订阅的服务提供数字内容，包括游戏服务 Apple Arcade； Apple Fitness+，个性化健身服务； Apple Music，为用户提供精心策划的聆听体验； Apple News+，新闻和杂志服务； Apple TV，提供原创内容和体育直播。该公司通过其零售店、在线商店以及直销队伍销售其产品并转售第三方产品；通过其各种服务平台提供的服务；以及第三方蜂窝网络运营商和其他经销商。它服務於","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"消費性電子產品","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-22","o":248.3,"h":256.64,"l":248.12,"c":256.08,"v":105517400},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":255.88,"h":257.34,"l":253.58,"c":254.43,"v":60275200},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":255.22,"h":255.74,"l":251.04,"c":252.31,"v":42303700},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":253.21,"h":257.17,"l":251.71,"c":256.87,"v":55202100},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":254.1,"h":257.6,"l":253.78,"c":255.46,"v":46076300},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":254.56,"h":255.0,"l":253.01,"c":254.43,"v":40127700},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":254.86,"h":255.92,"l":253.11,"c":254.63,"v":37704300},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":255.04,"h":258.79,"l":254.93,"c":255.45,"v":48713900},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":256.58,"h":258.18,"l":254.15,"c":257.13,"v":42630200},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":254.67,"h":259.24,"l":253.95,"c":258.02,"v":49155600},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":257.99,"h":259.07,"l":255.05,"c":256.69,"v":44664100},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":256.81,"h":257.4,"l":255.43,"c":256.48,"v":31955800},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":256.52,"h":258.52,"l":256.11,"c":258.06,"v":36496900},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":257.81,"h":258.0,"l":253.14,"c":254.04,"v":38322000},{"t":"2025-10-10","o":254.94,"h":256.38,"l":244.0,"c":245.27,"v":61999100},{"t":"2025-10-13","o":249.38,"h":249.69,"l